# Team: Runners
pages.append(DialogBuilder("guidebook/runners")
    .translate_title("§l§7Team: Runners")
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.runners.1")
        .translate("The runners have a simple goal: §lsurvival§r§7. Start on one end of the map, and §lsneak§r§7 §lor§r§7 §ldash§r§7 §lyour§r§7 §lway§r §lto§7 §lthe§r§7 §lend§r§7 under the noses of the hunters. Your teammates care naught for your survival, and may only choose to help you if it benefits them.")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.runners.2")
        .translate("You have many means of survival at your disposal. Your model is §l33% smaller§r§7, allowing you to fit through little tunnels and hide behind small rocks. Furthermore, you are quite nimble, §land sprint in every direction!")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.runners.3")
        .translate("For each bit of progress your team makes toward the finish line, the hunters are alerted, and may choose to warp backward and cut you off.\
            \n§4[!]§r§c Map progress is marked by bands between each segment. §lThe first to each band is awarded extra points!")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .page("guidebook/health")
    .page("guidebook/hiding")
    .prev("guidebook/intro")
    .build())

pages.append(DialogBuilder("guidebook/hiding")
    .translate_title("§7Mechanic: Hiding")
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.hiding.1")
        .translate("Runners have more than one way to achieve stealth. Besides their short stature and their lack of audible movement, they're capable of reducing their form even further on command.")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.hiding.2")
        .translate("----------- Mouse Form ------------")
        .color("dark_gray")
        .bold()
        .build())
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.hiding.3")
        .translate("After crouching for a moment, you'll enter a §lHiding§r§7 state. This hides the majority of your body, making you appear as a §llittle§r§7 §lmouse§r§7 to others.")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .line_item(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.hiding.4")
        .translate("Little Mouse (not-to-scale)")
        .color("gray")
        .bold()
        .build(), 
        {
            "id": "minecraft:player_head",
            "count": 1,
            "components": {
                "minecraft:profile": {
                    "properties": [
                        {
                            "name": "textures", 
                            "value": "eyJ0ZXh0dXJlcyI6eyJTS0lOIjp7InVybCI6Imh0dHA6Ly90ZXh0dXJlcy5taW5lY3JhZnQubmV0L3RleHR1cmUvZjM3OWUwOTI1MjgxNzMxNGJkMGI2OTRmN2Q1M2I0OGFmMmM3ZmE4NDk5MTA5ODAyYTQxYmIyOTRkMmY5M2UzZSJ9fX0="
                        }
                    ]
                }
            }
        }
    )
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.hiding.5")
        .translate("While §lHiding§r§7, you lose the ability to punch the killers, and you become significantly less nimble. However, you're much harder to spot, and blend into more areas.")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .prev("guidebook/runners")
    .build())

pages.append(DialogBuilder("guidebook/health")
    .translate_title("§7Mechanic: Health/Injury")
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.health.1")
        .translate("Prey are fragile little things. With each attack from the killer, or bump into a hazard, you lose health and rack up injuries.")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.health.2")
        .translate("------------ Health ------------")
        .color("red")
        .bold()
        .build())
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.health.3")
        .translate("Normally, runners are tough, with about %s. However, as the runners outnumber the amount of killers, their health decreases to match; though quite resilient in a one-on-one, you may have to rely on your teammates and stealth to get through.")
        .color("gray")
        .with_text(TextBuilder("§c30x ❤§r")
            .build())
        .build())
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.health.4")
        .translate("Damage activates your survival instincts, propelling your body with the power of adrenaline. Each time you take a hit, you gain a temporary speed boost to try and get away!")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.health.5")
        .translate("------------ Injuries ------------")
        .color("dark_red")
        .bold()
        .build())
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.health.6")
        .translate("As you rack up damage, your injuries become more and more impactful, slowly hindering your ability to freely move, slowing you down to a point of vulnerability unless given aid.")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.health.7")
        .translate("§lThough damage is permanent§r§7, your wounds are not. When encountering another runner, you can '§l§6dance§r§7' at each-other by repeatedly crouching. This is known as '§d§lsharing love§r§7', and decreases the movement penalties of both runners, at the cost of being quite loud..\
        \n§4[!]§r§c In a 1v1, your vitality is greatly increased, eliminating injury-based penalties.")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .prev("guidebook/runners")
    .build())

# Team: Killers
pages.append(DialogBuilder("guidebook/killers")
    .translate_title("§l§6Team: Killers")
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.killers.1")
        .translate("Despite bearing the job of a hunter, killers are often put under pressure to guard the §lFinish Line§r§7. Your primary goal is to get rid of the runners, and if they reach the other side of the map, you have no way of following them.")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.killers.2")
        .translate("This means your gameplay is as much §orisk management§r§7 as it is of being the risk. Every chase gives the other runners time to advance, so don't overcommit, and don't get too confident in guesses.")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .page("guidebook/attacking")
    .page("guidebook/backdoor")
    .prev("guidebook/intro")
    .build())

pages.append(DialogBuilder("guidebook/attacking")
    .translate_title("§6Mechanic: Attacking")
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.attacking.1")
        .translate("The opposing runners rarely die from a single strike. However, the more the runners outnumber you, the more vulnerable they are to your attacks, even dying in two hits!")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.attacking.2")
        .translate("You have a little more reach, and can swing as much as you like. But once you land a hit, the runners get a huge boost, and you stagger as you recover. Each hit matters, so make it count!")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.attacking.3")
        .translate("------------ Weapons ------------")
        .color("gold")
        .bold()
        .build())
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.attacking.4")
        .translate("By default, you only have your Claws to fight with. Other weapons can be selected during §cSkill §cSelection§7, ranging from simple damage or recovery increases to full-on ranged weapons.")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.attacking.5")
        .translate("------------ Points ------------")
        .color("dark_green")
        .bold()
        .build())
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.attacking.6")
        .translate("Each hit grants you some amount of points, and if present, even shares a little with your team.\nThis is based on the §opercentage§r§7 of damage you deal, §lrewarding you the same no matter how you spread out hits.")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .prev("guidebook/killers")
    .build())

pages.append(DialogBuilder("guidebook/backdoor")
    .translate_title("§7Mechanic: Backdoor")
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.backdoor.1")
        .translate("By instinct, you know many routes that the runners do not. As the runners advance ahead of you, you may use the §l§cBackdoor§r§7 to quickly teleport ahead of their current progress, and regain your position.")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .line_item(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.backdoor.2")
        .translate("Band Backdoor <------------")
        .color("red")
        .bold()
        .build(), 
        {
            "id": "minecraft:dark_oak_door",
            "count": 1
        }
    )
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.backdoor.3")
        .translate("Be careful, as each use of the §l§cBackdoor§r§7 warps you a little further back than the runners have pushed. With excessive or over-urgent use, you may end up conceding much more ground than is necessary.")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .line(TextBuilder("menu.guidebook.backdoor.4")
        .translate("Furthermore, the warp is audible to every runner. Many runners may try to bait the warp by 'claiming' bands without crossing through the next segment, and every runner will know to advance when you warp.")
        .color("gray")
        .build())
    .prev("guidebook/killers")
    .build())

for page in pages:
    append function menu:guidebook/watch_selection:
        execute if score @s menu.guidebook.selected_page matches page.get("index") run function page.get("id").replace('menu:guidebook', 'menu:guidebook/page'):
            dialog show @s page.get("dialog")
